few_shot:
CLASSIFY the customer's support ticket into exactly one allowed category: billing, delivery, technical, fraud. Return a JSON-only reply of the form {"category": "...", "reason": "..."}. The category must be one of the four allowed categories.
EXAMPLES:
Ticket: I was charged twice for one order.
JSON: {"category": "billing", "reason": "The customer reports a duplicate charge."}
Ticket: Someone made an unauthorized transaction on my card.
JSON: {"category": "fraud", "reason": "The customer reports an unauthorized transaction."}
